  "description": "【New Upgrade】This best electric bike was upgraded to 35Ah high capacity and long-range removable UL-certified lithium battery, with 500W brushless motor to provide more power and range for daily commuting and adventure. Maximum speed of 30MPH, 55 Miles in electric mode, 80 Miles in PAS 1 Mode.\n\n【Safety and Security】Front and rear hydraulic disc brakes offer the cyclist a more powerful and consistent method of braking across all weather conditions. Get better modulation, increased stopping power, and more safety. The folding electric bicycles is come with a super bright LED headlight, brake rear light, and warning spoke reflectors providing you with a comfortable and more safe riding journey wherever you go.\n\n【Easy Control Easy Read】With a full-color LCD, thumb throttle, LCD control, and Shimano 7-speed shifting system, new riders can also easily get up and running. Full-color LCD screens have higher resolution and better sunlight readability. There is a USB charging port on the left side of the display to charge your device.\n\n【FRONT SUSPENSION FORK COMBINED WITH 3.0 OFF ROAD TIRE】-- The solid aluminum frame is equipped with a front suspension fork and saddle shock suspension system, with a sensitive response and can be smoothly handled, even if the road bumps can be smoothly through. This adults electric bike is combined with 20” x 3.0” Fat Tires, all-terrain tires can be unobstructed on mountains, mud, snow, and beaches.\n\n【AFTER-SALE SERVICE & WARRANTY】-- With a one-year warranty for the electric bike's motor, battery, and charger. Natural damage or quality problems during the warranty period, we promise to respond within 24 hours and provide great after-sales service. Enjoy your riding experience!\n\n【Tips】-- Bike weight: 77 Recommendedheight: 5’4”-6’4”. Package Included: 1 x Bike; 1 x Battery; 1 x Charger; 1 x Tool kit; 1 x Backrest; and 1 x User manual.",
